<title>GERMANY: Eva Air names new Germany manager.</title>
<headline>Eva Air names new Germany manager.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eva Air said it has appointed Ming Fang Tsai as its new Germany country manager.</p>
<p>Tsai was previously Eva Air cargo and passenger sales manager at Kaohsiung airport and replaces Paul Chien who has returned to Taiwan, an airline statement said. --Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax +44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
